   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
         Output: (PARTIAL variance(tenk1.unique1)), (PARTIAL sum((tenk1.unique1)::bigint)), (PARTIAL regr_count((tenk1.unique1)::double precision, (tenk1.unique1)::double precision))
