                     ->  Seq Scan on public.tenk1 tenk1_2
                           Output: tenk1_2.unique1
                     ->  Seq Scan on public.tenk1 tenk1_3
                           Output: tenk1_3.unique1
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
 Settings: enable_indexonlyscan = 'off', min_parallel_table_scan_size = '0', optimizer = 'off', parallel_setup_cost = '0', parallel_tuple_cost = '0'
